<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, DEC 10.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, DEC 10.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Dec 10	Dec 9	 DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  244.930     244.440     237.040    3.33 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  304.050     304.000     303.640    0.14 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.590     157.450     165.490   -4.77 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.596	46.608	48.410   -3.75 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  405.100     401.600     366.280   10.60 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.510     140.420     147.886   -4.99 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.005	15.979	14.975    6.88 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  216.170     215.840     230.135   -6.07 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.874	 1.871	 1.939   -3.35 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.561	 1.559	 1.575   -0.89 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  184.660     184.900     206.030  -10.37 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
